{"id":"n64892-2-8","stage":4,"title":"순발력 · 爆发力","scene":"人物与表达","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n64892-2-8-1","ko":"와, 어떻게 이 짧은 시간에 그런 생각을 했어?","zh":"哇，这么短的时间内你怎么就想出这个主意了？","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"와,","meaning":"啊，咦","explanation":"와：啊，咦","readings":[{"term":"와","audio":"/audio/d536e6255a4151eae226.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"17872","senseId":"1","lemma":"와","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"어떻게","meaning":"怎么样","explanation":"어떻다：怎么样；게：使前面的动作或状态修饰后文，也用于 -게 되다、-게 하다 等搭配。","readings":[{"term":"어떻다","audio":"/audio/e0a8c114a77e081454d1.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"70482","senseId":"1","lemma":"어떻다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"이","meaning":"这，这个","explanation":"이：这，这个","readings":[{"term":"이","audio":"/audio/8bafb6b7d17ead4985bf.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"71687","senseId":"1","lemma":"이","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"짧은","meaning":"短","explanation":"짧다：短；은：修饰后面的名词。形容词后表示当前性质；动词后通常表示已完成的动作或结果状态。","readings":[{"term":"짧다","audio":"/audio/6dab7d40289b180d0cb0.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"71363","senseId":"2","lemma":"짧다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"시간에","meaning":"时间","explanation":"시간：时间；에：格助词，表示时间、位置、去向、对象等；需结合整句理解。","readings":[{"term":"시간","audio":"/audio/4692cef5ac69eb37bd53.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62841","senseId":"1","lemma":"시간","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"그런","meaning":"那种，那样","explanation":"그런：那种，那样","readings":[{"term":"그런","audio":"/audio/d14f5bfb24390ed9c4da.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"60341","senseId":"1","lemma":"그런","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"생각을","meaning":"念头，想法","explanation":"생각：念头，想法；을：宾格助词，标记动作对象。","readings":[{"term":"생각","audio":"/audio/6ac12a8f8e4e4c22657b.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"58162","senseId":"3","lemma":"생각","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"했어?","meaning":"做，干","explanation":"하다：做，干；었：过去或完成，常与词干缩合。；어：非敬语句末；与熟悉的人或晚辈交谈，语调决定陈述、询问等语气。","readings":[{"term":"하다","audio":"/audio/505de0a2f6be73fa7758.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"73277","senseId":"1","lemma":"하다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]}],"words":[{"id":"d536e6255a4151ea","term":"와","zh":"啊，咦","audio":"/audio/d536e6255a4151eae226.mp3","entryId":"17872","definition":"遇到惊喜时发出的声音。","pronunciation":["와"]},{"id":"e0a8c114a77e0814","term":"어떻다","zh":"怎么样","audio":"/audio/e0a8c114a77e081454d1.mp3","entryId":"70482","definition":"想法、感觉、状态或境况等成为什么状况。","pronunciation":["어떠타"]},{"id":"8bafb6b7d17ead49","term":"이","zh":"这，这个","audio":"/audio/8bafb6b7d17ead4985bf.mp3","entryId":"71687","definition":"用于指示与话者离得近的物品，或用于指示话者所想的对象。","pronunciation":["이"]},{"id":"6dab7d40289b180d","term":"짧다","zh":"短","audio":"/audio/6dab7d40289b180d0cb0.mp3","entryId":"71363","definition":"从一个时间到另一个时间相隔不久。","pronunciation":["짤따"]},{"id":"4692cef5ac69eb37","term":"시간","zh":"时间","audio":"/audio/4692cef5ac69eb37bd53.mp3","entryId":"62841","definition":"从某一时候到另一时候的期间。","pronunciation":["시간"]},{"id":"d14f5bfb24390ed9","term":"그런","zh":"那种，那样","audio":"/audio/d14f5bfb24390ed9c4da.mp3","entryId":"60341","definition":"状态、模样、性质等那个样子的。","pronunciation":["그런"]},{"id":"6ac12a8f8e4e4c22","term":"생각","zh":"念头，想法","audio":"/audio/6ac12a8f8e4e4c22657b.mp3","entryId":"58162","definition":"想做某事的心理或关注；或指那样的事。","pronunciation":["생각"]},{"id":"505de0a2f6be73fa","term":"하다","zh":"做，干","audio":"/audio/505de0a2f6be73fa7758.mp3","entryId":"73277","definition":"进行某种行动、动作或活动。","pronunciation":["하다"]}],"audio":"/audio/0618a5450b03c135bff2.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n64892-2-8-2","ko":"내가 워낙 순발력이 좋잖아.","zh":"我反应本来就很快啊。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"내가","meaning":"我","explanation":"나：我；가：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"나","audio":"/audio/1098bbe54520ab2a367c.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"60931","senseId":"1","lemma":"나","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"워낙","meaning":"本来，根本","explanation":"워낙：本来，根本","readings":[{"term":"워낙","audio":"/audio/290a56095c0643792431.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"26711","senseId":"1","lemma":"워낙","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"순발력이","meaning":"爆发力","explanation":"순발력：爆发力；이：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"순발력","audio":"/audio/fa08ee0850ede97834ea.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"64892","senseId":"2","lemma":"순발력","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"좋잖아.","meaning":"好，强","explanation":"좋다：好，强；잖아：提醒对方已知的事实，非敬语：“不是……嘛”。","readings":[{"term":"좋다","audio":"/audio/86d0464f1c6da40233cd.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"79033","senseId":"15","lemma":"좋다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]}],"words":[{"id":"1098bbe54520ab2a","term":"나","zh":"我","audio":"/audio/1098bbe54520ab2a367c.mp3","entryId":"60931","definition":"说话人在朋友或晚辈面前用来指称自己。","pronunciation":["나"]},{"id":"290a56095c064379","term":"워낙","zh":"本来，根本","audio":"/audio/290a56095c0643792431.mp3","entryId":"26711","definition":"原来就。","pronunciation":["워낙"]},{"id":"fa08ee0850ede978","term":"순발력","zh":"爆发力","audio":"/audio/fa08ee0850ede97834ea.mp3","entryId":"64892","definition":"某事发生时瞬间做出判断说话或行动的能力。","pronunciation":["순발력"]},{"id":"86d0464f1c6da402","term":"좋다","zh":"好，强","audio":"/audio/86d0464f1c6da40233cd.mp3","entryId":"79033","definition":"和别的相比，质量或水平等更高。","pronunciation":["조ː타"]}],"audio":"/audio/5b2dfaf11d634e17a22e.mp3","speakerIndex":1}],"difficulty":2.665,"source":{"url":"https://krdict.korean.go.kr/chn/dicSearch/SearchView?ParaWordNo=64892","label":"国立国语院韩国语—汉语学习词典","license":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/2.0/kr/"},"sourceSenseId":"2","sourceLevel":"고급","day":131,"sequenceScore":2.4917,"questions":[{"lineIndex":0,"options":["我反应本来就很快啊。","哇，这么短的时间内你怎么就想出这个主意了？","选什么职业比较好呢？"],"answer":1},{"lineIndex":1,"options":["哇，这么短的时间内你怎么就想出这个主意了？","选什么职业比较好呢？","我反应本来就很快啊。"],"answer":2}]}
